{"headword":"בָּלַע","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. swallow down, swallow up, engulf</strong> (idea of quickness, suddenness) <strong>(</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">بَلِعَ</span> <em>swallow</em>, Ethiopic በልዐ <em>eat</em>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּלַע ܒܠܰܥ</span>; Assyrian <em>belû</em>, Pi. <em>destroy</em> Zim<sup>BP 27</sup><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּלַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:15\" href=\"/Job.20.15\">Jb 20:15</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּלָעַנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:34\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.34\">Je 51:34</a> (Qr, cf. 𝔊 Kt -<span dir=\"rtl\">נוּ</span>); 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּֽלְעָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:30\" href=\"/Numbers.16.30\">Nu 16:30</a>; 3 pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּלָעוּנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 124:3\" href=\"/Psalms.124.3\">ψ 124:3</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְלָ֑ע</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:18\" href=\"/Job.20.18\">Jb 20:18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּבְלַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:12\" href=\"/Exodus.7.12\">Ex 7:12</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְלָעֶנָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.4\">Is 28:4</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּבְלַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:32\" href=\"/Numbers.16.32\">Nu 16:32</a> + 2 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּבְלָעֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:16\" href=\"/Psalms.69.16\">ψ 69:16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּבְלָעֵנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:34\" href=\"/Numbers.16.34\">Nu 16:34</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּבְלָעֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.6\">Dt 11:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּבְלָעֵמוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:12\" href=\"/Exodus.15.12\">Ex 15:12</a>; 3 mpl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְלָעֻהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 8:7\" href=\"/Hosea.8.7\">Ho 8:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 8:3\" href=\"/Hosea.8.3\">3</a> fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּבְלַעְנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:7\" href=\"/Genesis.41.7\">Gn 41:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּבְלַעְןָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:24\" href=\"/Genesis.41.24\">Gn 41:24</a>, 1 pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִבְלָעֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.12\">Pr 1:12</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִבְלֹעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 2:1\" href=\"/Jonah.2.1\">Jon 2:1</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּלְעִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 7:19\" href=\"/Job.7.19\">Jb 7:19</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>swallow down</em>, c. acc. <a data-ref=\"Job 7:19\" href=\"/Job.7.19\">Jb 7:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.4\">Is 28:4</a>, subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּג</span> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 2:1\" href=\"/Jonah.2.1\">Jon 2:1</a>; subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁבֳּלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:7\" href=\"/Genesis.41.7\">Gn 41:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:24\" href=\"/Genesis.41.24\">24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַטֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:12\" href=\"/Exodus.7.12\">Ex 7:12</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>swallow up, engulf</em>, subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:12\" href=\"/Exodus.15.12\">Ex 15:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:30\" href=\"/Numbers.16.30\">Nu 16:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:32\" href=\"/Numbers.16.32\">32</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:34\" href=\"/Numbers.16.34\">34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:10\" href=\"/Numbers.26.10\">26:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.6\">Dt 11:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:17\" href=\"/Psalms.106.17\">ψ 106:17</a>; fig. of greed <a data-ref=\"Job 20:15\" href=\"/Job.20.15\">Jb 20:15</a> (obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַיִל</span>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">קיא</span> <em>vomit</em>); of violence, extortion <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.12\">Pr 1:12</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(כִּשְׁאוֹל)</span>; of devastation by enemy <a data-ref=\"Hosea 8:7\" href=\"/Hosea.8.7\">Ho 8:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:34\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.34\">Je 51:34</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 124:3\" href=\"/Psalms.124.3\">ψ 124:3</a>; overwhelming by calamity <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:19\" href=\"/Psalms.69.19\">ψ 69:19</a> (subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">מצולה</span>); of full enjoyment, profit <a data-ref=\"Job 20:18\" href=\"/Job.20.18\">Jb 20:18</a> (no obj.)"}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִבְלַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 8:8\" href=\"/Hosea.8.8\">Ho 8:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נִבְלְעוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.7\">Is 28:7</a>;—<em>swallowed up</em>, i.e. devastated <a data-ref=\"Hosea 8:8\" href=\"/Hosea.8.8\">Ho 8:8</a>; engulfed by wine (yet cf. <strong>Pi.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.12\">Is 3:12</a>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.7\">Is 28:7</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ מן־היין</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁגוּ בַשֵּׁכָר</span>)."}],"form":"Niph."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּלַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.8\">Is 25:8</a> + 3 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">וּבִלַּע</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.7\">Is 25:7</a>; 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּלֵּ֑עוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.12\">Is 3:12</a>; 1 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּלָּ֑עְנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:16\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.16\">La 2:16</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּלַּעֲנוּהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:25\" href=\"/Psalms.35.25\">ψ 35:25</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְבַלַּע־</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.28\">Pr 19:28</a>, sf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְבַלְּעֶנּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 8:18\" href=\"/Job.8.18\">Jb 8:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.20\">Pr 21:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְבַלְּעֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:10\" href=\"/Psalms.21.10\">ψ 21:10</a>; 3 fs. sf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבַלְּעֶנּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:12\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.12\">Ec 10:12</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבַלַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.19\">2 S 20:19</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתְּבַלְּעֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 10:8\" href=\"/Job.10.8\">Jb 10:8</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבַלַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.20\">2 S 20:20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבַלֵּ֑עַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.3\">Is 19:3</a>; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּלַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:10\" href=\"/Psalms.55.10\">ψ 55:10</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּלַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:20\" href=\"/Numbers.4.20\">Nu 4:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:13\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.13\">Hb 1:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּלֵּ֑עַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:8\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.8\">La 2:8</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּלְּעוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 2:3\" href=\"/Job.2.3\">Jb 2:3</a>; Pt. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְבַלְּעָ֑יִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.19\">Is 49:19</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>swallow</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:20\" href=\"/Numbers.4.20\">Nu 4:20</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">כְּבַלַּע</span> <em>as a swallowing</em> = for an instant); elsewhere"}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>swallow up, engulf</em>, usually c. acc.,"},{"senses":[{"definition":"fig. of destruction, ruin, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.12\">Is 3:12</a> (obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּרֶךְ</span>); (Ba from a √ II. <span dir=\"rtl\">בלע</span> <em>confound</em>, cf. Di; v. also <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.15\">9:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.3\">19:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.7\">28:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:10\" href=\"/Psalms.55.10\">ψ 55:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:27\" href=\"/Psalms.107.27\">107:27</a>); subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:2\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.2\">La 2:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:5\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.5\">5</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:8\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 2:3\" href=\"/Job.2.3\">Jb 2:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 10:8\" href=\"/Job.10.8\">10:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:10\" href=\"/Psalms.21.10\">ψ 21:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אכל</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.3\">Is 19:3</a> (obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵצָה</span>), i.e. <em>confuse, confound;</em> so <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:10\" href=\"/Psalms.55.10\">ψ 55:10</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּלַּע אֲדֹנָי פַּלַּג לְשׁוֹנָם</span> <em>confuse, Lord, divide their speech</em> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בלל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:7\" href=\"/Genesis.11.7\">Gn 11:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:9\" href=\"/Genesis.11.9\">9</a> & v. De Che); subj. wicked men, enemies <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:25\" href=\"/Psalms.35.25\">ψ 35:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.19\">Is 49:19</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:16\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.16\">La 2:16</a> (abs.) <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:13\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.13\">Hb 1:13</a>; obj. reflex. in sense <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:12\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.12\">Ec 10:12</a>; = annihilate <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.7\">Is 25:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.8\">8</a>;"}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"lit. = <em>destroy</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.19\">2 S 20:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.20\">20</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הִשְׁחִית</span>); indef. subj. <a data-ref=\"Job 8:18\" href=\"/Job.8.18\">Jb 8:18</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יב׳ ממקמו</span>;"}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"fig. for greedily (seize, adopt) practice <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.28\">Pr 19:28</a>, for extravagance, squandering <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.20\">Pr 21:20</a>."}],"num":"c."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Pi."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְבֻלַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.16\">2 S 17:16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יְבֻלָּ֑ע</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 37:20\" href=\"/Job.37.20\">Jb 37:20</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְבֻלָּעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.15\">Is 9:15</a>;—<em>be swallowed up</em>, i.e. destroyed <a data-ref=\"Job 37:20\" href=\"/Job.37.20\">Jb 37:20</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּן־יְבֻלַּע לַמֶּלֶךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.16\">2 S 17:16</a> (impers.) ruined <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.15\">Is 9:15</a> (yet cf. sub <strong>Pi.</strong>)"}],"form":"Pu."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתְבַּלָּ֑ע</span><a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:27\" href=\"/Psalms.107.27\">ψ 107:27</a> (subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">חכמה</span>) their wisdom is all gone, ‘they are at their wit’s end’ (cf. sub <strong>Pi.)</strong>"}],"form":"Hithp."}]},"rid":"BDB01274","strong_numbers":["1104"],"next_hw":"בֶּ֫לַע","prev_hw":"בָּלַס","all_cited":true,"root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["1180","1181","1182"],"TWOT":["251","251c"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}